\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->2 min</span></div><h1>Bon Plan YesStyle : mixsoon Bean Essence à 22,40€ au lieu de 32€ (-30%)</h1><p class=\"article-subtitle\">L&#x27;essence mixsoon Bean Essence 50ml à 22,40€ au lieu de 32€ sur YesStyle. Soja fermenté, hydratation et contrôle du sébum. -30% sur le soin culte.</p><div class=\"article-rating-bar\"><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le prix sur YesStyle<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"article-hero-image\" style=\"background:#fff;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;max-height:450px\"><img alt=\"Bon plan mixsoon Bean Essence 22 euros\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;max-height:450px\" src=\"/images/articles/bon-plan-mixsoon-bean-essence-22-euros-au-lieu-de-32.svg\"/></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"background:var(--surface, #fefce8);padding:1.25rem;border-radius:12px;margin:2rem 0\"><form style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--primary)\"><path d=\"M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4\"></path></svg><span style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:0.9rem;margin-right:8px\">Recevez les bons plans par email</span><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Votre email\" required=\"\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border, #e5e7eb);font-size:0.9rem\" value=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:8px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--primary);color:white;font-weight:600;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.9rem\">OK</button></form></div><div class=\"article-content\"><div><p>\n<h2>22,40€ au lieu de 32€ — l'essence au soja qui fait fureur</h2><p>La <strong>mixsoon Bean Essence</strong> est l'un des produits K-Beauty les plus tendance. Formulée à base d'extrait de <strong>soja fermenté</strong>, elle hydrate et lisse la peau comme aucune autre essence. Sur YesStyle : <strong>22,40€ au lieu de 32€</strong>, soit <strong>-30%</strong>.</p><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le prix sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Le soja fermenté, l'ingrédient miracle coréen</h2><ul><li>🫘 <strong>Extrait de soja fermenté</strong> : riche en isoflavones, booste l'élasticité</li>\n<li>🍐 <strong>Extraits fermentés</strong> de grenade, d'orge et de poire</li>\n<li>💧 <strong>Hydratation longue durée</strong> sans effet gras</li>\n<li>🧴 <strong>Contrôle le sébum</strong> : parfait pour les peaux mixtes</li>\n<li>✨ <strong>Lisse le grain de peau</strong> : pores affinés, teint unifié</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Comment l'intégrer à votre routine</h2><p>1. <strong>Nettoyage</strong> (double cleansing)\n2. <strong>Tonique</strong> (Anua ou SKIN1004)\n3. <strong>→ mixsoon Bean Essence</strong> ← c'est ici\n4. <strong>Sérum</strong> (si besoin)\n5. <strong>Crème hydratante</strong>\n6. <strong>SPF</strong> (le matin)</p><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le prix sur YesStyle <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Ce qu'en disent les utilisatrices</h2><p>Les retours les plus fréquents :\n<ul><li>\"Ma peau est plus lisse en 1 semaine\"</li>\n<li>\"L'odeur est douce et naturelle\"</li>\n<li>\"Pénètre en 10 secondes, pas de film gras\"</li>\n<li>\"Mon soin favori de toute ma routine\"</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th></th><th>Prix</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Prix normal</td>\n<td>32,00€</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prix soldé</td>\n<td>22,40€ (-30%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Avec code WOMEN26</strong></td>\n<td><strong>~19,04€ (-40%)</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p>⚠️ <em>Prix constaté le 8 mars 2026.</em>\n</p></div></div><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><div style=\"text-align:center;margin:40px 0;padding:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%);border-radius:16px;border:2px solid #FECDD3\"><p style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--foreground)\">Profiter de cette offre</p><a href=\"https://ystyle.co/kqCm2\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" style=\"padding:14px 32px;font-size:1rem\">Voir le prix sur YesStyle<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></article><div class=\"ad-container \" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"><ins class=\"adsbygoogle\" style=\"display:block\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-5064203547863113\" data-ad-slot=\"1564426359\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-full-width-responsive=\"true\"></ins></div><section class=\"related-articles\"><h2>A lire aussi</h2><div class=\"articles-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr))\"><a href=\"/article/bon-plan-cosrx-snail-mucin-essence-24-euros-au-lieu-de-30\" class=\"card\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:160px;overflow:hidden\"><img alt=\"Bon plan COSRX Snail Mucin Essence 24 euros\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" style=\"position:absolute;height: